# Dashboard Wireframe

## Proposed FinTrust Business Intelligence Dashboard

The proposed dashboard is designed to communicate customer behaviour, transaction performance, transaction channels, transaction status and risk-related patterns.

### KPI Cards

- Total Customers
- Total Transactions
- Total Transaction Value
- Average Transaction Value
- Successful Transaction Rate
- Risk Review Rate

### Filters / Slicers

- Date Range
- Customer Type
- Account Type
- Transaction Channel
- Transaction Status
- Location

### Dashboard Visual Sections

- Transaction Volume & Value Trend
- Transactions by Channel
- Key Insights
- Customers by Age Group
- Transaction Status
- Top Locations by Transaction Volume
- Customer Segment Performance
- Risk Review – Key Patterns
- Overall Performance

The wireframe is a layout proposal only. No actual KPI figures or analytical conclusions are presented at this stage. Actual values will be populated after data profiling and analysis.
